1
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,020
I will have someone

2
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,730
use the best medicine for your wound.

3
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:40,930
The girl and I will take our leave first.

4
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,160
Uncle,

5
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:50,400
Bai Ze just saved me.

6
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,060
Why are you so cold to him?

7
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,460
I see.

8
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,630
It's because of Feng Qingwu, right?

9
00:00:58,630 --> 00:00:59,860
She is your fiancée.

10
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:01,900
But Bai Ze only knocked her out.

11
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,330
You...

12
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:16,330
Listen to me, girl.

13
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:20,800
Stay away from that boy
from Yungong Pavilion from now on.

14
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,330
Where is this?

15
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:35,800
Wu Hall.

16
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,460
From now on,

17
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,960
you can't go anywhere.

18
00:01:39,330 --> 00:01:40,400
As for the reason,

19
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:42,460
I think you should know.

20
00:01:43,930 --> 00:01:44,759
What do you mean?

21
00:01:44,759 --> 00:01:46,200
Just for that wild girl?

22
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,930
Attacking the Sect Leader's wife.

23
00:01:48,930 --> 00:01:50,360
Locking you up

24
00:01:50,729 --> 00:01:53,060
is already the Sect Leader showing mercy.

25
00:02:17,530 --> 00:02:18,700
Ye Qifeng,

26
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,360
you seem to have forgotten
what I am best at.

27
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:28,829
Isn't this Lady Feng Qingwu
who hurt me last night?

28
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Are you planning to apologize to me?

29
00:02:31,530 --> 00:02:34,300
I came to you to discuss
an important matter.

30
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,530
I can tell Mr. Bai likes A Kong very much.

31
00:02:38,530 --> 00:02:40,030
Why don't we join forces

32
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,329
so we can each get the one we love?

33
00:02:44,829 --> 00:02:46,200
What a good proposal.

34
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,329
Too bad I'm not interested.

35
00:02:50,060 --> 00:02:50,860
Ah!

36
00:02:54,130 --> 00:02:54,930
Feng Qingwu,

37
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,700
escaping without permission
adds to your crimes.

38
00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:59,200
By the Sect Leader's order,

39
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,000
I will escort you to Mount Qilin.

40
00:03:01,300 --> 00:03:02,330
If you dare to escape again,

41
00:03:02,330 --> 00:03:04,460
you will be punished by the sect rules.

42
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,000
Ye Qifeng,

43
00:03:08,030 --> 00:03:10,090
hundreds of years of our friendship,

44
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:12,560
and all I get is punishment
by the sect rules?

45
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:14,560
This is already out of respect
for our hundreds of years

46
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,290
of friendship and Senior Feng.

47
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:19,760
Aren't you afraid
I'll detonate the puppet?

48
00:03:21,100 --> 00:03:22,000
What puppet?

49
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,829
Who is your puppet?

50
00:03:28,660 --> 00:03:32,130
Sister, will you stay in Yan Sect
this time you come back?

51
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:36,200
Yes, I will stay to cure Uncle.

52
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,500
Great!

53
00:03:40,730 --> 00:03:41,530
Qiongqi,

54
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:43,130
why are you here?

55
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,200
You...

56
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,400
Oh no,

57
00:03:48,829 --> 00:03:51,690
his state is the same as
when he went berserk before.

58
00:03:55,130 --> 00:03:56,400
If I guess correctly,

59
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:59,100
the puppet Feng Qingwu mentioned should be

60
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,800
Qiongqi.

61
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:08,100
Qiongqi, why are you here?

62
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,100
I think I just...

63
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:17,730
killed someone.

64
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:19,959
Bai, hold on.

65
00:04:24,330 --> 00:04:26,530
Why did you block in front of me just now?

66
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:29,660
Because I like you, Sister.

67
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,930
You look very much like her.

68
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,130
Every time I see you, I think of her.

69
00:04:36,330 --> 00:04:37,130
Her?

70
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:40,560
I can't remember her face
and voice clearly anymore.

71
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,620
But I just feel you two are very alike.

72
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:44,030
The first time I saw you,

73
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,460
I liked you in my heart.

74
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:46,560
Yes,

75
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,100
I like you too, Bai.

76
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:52,130
Then don't marry Uncle Zhi,

77
00:04:52,830 --> 00:04:54,130
marry me, okay?

78
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:58,330
Uncle Zhi is the old monster.

79
00:04:58,659 --> 00:05:00,460
His original name was Qi Zhezhi.

80
00:05:00,460 --> 00:05:03,390
But this name hasn't been used
for hundreds of years.

81
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:07,100
What a touching display of affection.

82
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,600
Let me help you out

83
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:12,930
and send you both to hell.

84
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:21,360
Prepare to die!

85
00:05:35,159 --> 00:05:37,820
I think you're the one
who should prepare to die.

86
00:05:41,930 --> 00:05:42,460
Lord Bai,

87
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:44,390
I'll send you back right away.

88
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,620
"Send us to hell," huh?

89
00:05:46,659 --> 00:05:47,920
"Prepare to die," huh?

90
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,600
Who is that kicking Hei Wuya so hard?
